                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "4 out of 10\n\nNot a terrible title but pretty forgettable wave game. As a game it's pretty well made, good cartoon visuals and plenty of level maps. The levels are painfully dull until around the 5 wave at which point you actually get a challenge going. Until then it's not very interesting. I discovered a bug where a final zombie must have got stuck as I wasn't able to progress during a game. Only occured once so can't tell if how common this bug could crop up.\n\n I got this in a cheap VR bundle which is fair enough for a throw away sum but not really worth paying full whack.",
